    "created_at": "2019-11-12T06:25:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-11-12T06:41:33Z",
    "body": "I found the character used by the prompt and the terminal also affect the cursor location.\r\n\r\nI can reproduce this with the default character \"❯\" and iTerm2 3.3.6 on Mac. If I change the character to \">\" then the problem goes away.\r\n\r\nI suspect it is due to zsh / terminal's handling of multi-byte utf-8 characters.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
