    "body": "I see the line wrapping issue with bash:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/938138/69911967-5a7d8900-13e0-11ea-9fe4-8b39b5999611.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nProblem only occurs when line break is disabled and git status module displayed.\r\n\r\n* starship 0.25.0\r\n* bash 3.2.57 (MacOS built-in)\r\n* iterm2\r\n* starship.toml\r\n  ```\r\n  [line_break]\r\n  disabled = true\r\n  ```\r\n* .bash_profile (commented out everything except for starship)\r\n  ```\r\n  eval \"$(starship init bash)\"\r\n  ```\r\n\r\n",
