    "created_at": "2019-12-10T10:58:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-12-10T10:58:53Z",
    "body": "At least for bash, I think we are missing `\\[` and `\\]` around the escape codes that color the opening and closing characters of git status.\r\n\r\n> Wrapping the tput output in \\[ \\] is recommended by the Bash man page. This helps Bash ignore non-printable characters so that it correctly calculates the size of the prompt.\r\n\r\nhttps://wiki.archlinux.org/index.php/Bash/Prompt_customization\r\n",
